Punctuation: #sym.dash.en, #sym.dash.em, #sym.percent, #sym.hash, #sym.at, #sym.dagger.

Currency: #sym.euro, #sym.dollar, #sym.pound, #sym.yen.

Marks: #sym.bullet, #sym.star.op, #sym.checkmark, #sym.copyright.

Quotes: #sym.quote.l.double, #sym.quote.r.double, #sym.quote.angle.l, #sym.quote.angle.r.

Brackets: #sym.bracket.double.l, #sym.bracket.double.r.

Shapes: #sym.circle.stroked.big, #sym.circle.filled.big, #sym.triangle.filled.r.

In math: $a dot.c b$, $a plus.minus b$, $a bullet b$, $a circle.filled.small b$.

More math: $a bracket.double.l b bracket.double.r$, $a colon.double.eq b$.
